	--  nudge   every 3-4 min while the character stands still: a 0.5-stud MoveTo step and back (games that watch MoveDirection,
	--          e.g. SAEGG AfkAutoClient). Never while seated, moving, falling, anchored or when Library.AntiAfkBusy() says busy.
	--  rejoin  a Roblox idle kick (error message with idle/AFK) rejoins the same server with the hub queued (queue_on_teleport);
	--          skipped when the Misc "Auto reconnect" toggle already handles it.
